{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A minimalistic travelling merchant simulator game</strong> - Walk around the town, sell items for profit, meet and interact with funny characters, upgrade your backpack and more. Each map includes new and unique mechanics and events, keeping the experience fresh and letting you strategise new ways to reach higher profits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930780/extras/19a81998d1d8ec526f152125e256fc90.avif?t=1767269261\" width=351 height=211 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a sketchy salesman, stand up against witch hunters or try out a medical tonic recipe a monk gave you. The events have multiple actions available, allowing you to play an <strong>active part in the story</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tight day-based gameplay loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sell and buy offers refresh each morning, letting you figure out where to go. Make sure to get home safely before the night, as sleeping outside leaves you vulnerable to lurking thieves!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Emergent puzzle-like gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930780/extras/d5063bad682ebc6b6d0990b9e771301a.avif?t=1767269261\" width=790 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The simplistic controls leads to all kinds of priorities. Do you take the safe path home but with overpriced wood or do you find another unexplored path?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play at your own pace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game is turn based but that doesn't mean it's has to be slow!</strong> Make quick decisions in the moment for a quick profit while also planning for long term investments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930780?t=1767269261","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930780/746e81fa075fd57163072dd39d2a860ea2dd493c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767269261","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930780/842edf89f8602b7239ac495bf2fb6ab9231910cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767269261","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930780/842edf89f8602b7239ac495bf2fb6ab9231910cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767269261","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A minimalistic travelling merchant simulator game</strong> - Walk around the town, sell items for profit, meet and interact with funny characters, upgrade your backpack and more. Each map includes new and unique mechanics and events, keeping the experience fresh and letting you strategise new ways to reach higher profits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930780/extras/19a81998d1d8ec526f152125e256fc90.avif?t=1767269261\" width=351 height=211 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a sketchy salesman, stand up against witch hunters or try out a medical tonic recipe a monk gave you. The events have multiple actions available, allowing you to play an <strong>active part in the story</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tight day-based gameplay loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sell and buy offers refresh each morning, letting you figure out where to go. Make sure to get home safely before the night, as sleeping outside leaves you vulnerable to lurking thieves!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Emergent puzzle-like gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930780/extras/d5063bad682ebc6b6d0990b9e771301a.avif?t=1767269261\" width=790 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The simplistic controls leads to all kinds of priorities. Do you take the safe path home but with overpriced wood or do you find another unexplored path?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play at your own pace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game is turn based but that doesn't mean it's has to be slow!</strong> Make quick decisions in the moment for a quick profit while also planning for long term investments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["NitramiuZ"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930780/7262b92c8ee65b7da139a28b1955b59afd6ff63a/header.jpg?t=1767269261","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3930780/1575209832/957883bc79a1ac89a86a4897180f308ced5972ec/1754611028/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754942549","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3930780/1575209832/957883bc79a1ac89a86a4897180f308ced5972ec/1754611028/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754942549","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3930780/1575209832/957883bc79a1ac89a86a4897180f308ced5972ec/1754611028/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754942549","id":257180052,"name":"Preview trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257180052/41ef90ca812cc5256e38093c14047aeab9d7019a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754942549"}],"name":"Merchanting in 1346","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Mini